  "id": "2231",
  "title": "What Fun Places Are There in Beijing?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2023-10-12",
  "synopsis": "Amy calls her friend Ben to share her experiences in Beijing and asks for more travel recommendations.\nIn this lesson, we will focus on sharing your travel experiences as well as asking about and discusssing travel recommendations.",
