    "sentence_translations": [
      "What Fun Places Are There in Beijing?",
      "",
      "Ben: Amy, how are you doing? Are you having fun in Beijing?",
      "",
      "Amy: I am. Beijing is so big!",
      "",
      "Ben: Where have you been so far?",
      "",
      "Amy: I have been to Tian’anmen Square and the Forbidden City. I also ate Peking duck. It was delicious.",
      "Ben, what other fun places are there in Beijing? Let me know.",
      "",
      "Ben: Beijing has lots of fun places. You can go to the Great Wall, Beihai Park, as well as Houhai.",
      "Houhai’s hutongs are very famous. There you’ll find lots of bars and teahouses. Lots of young people like it.",
      "",
      "Amy: Great. I’ve always wanted to go to the Great Wall, but it’s a little far. I’ll go the day after tomorrow.",
      "I will first go to have a look at Beihai Park and Houhai tomorrow.",
      "",
      "Ben: That sounds pretty good. I hope you enjoy your time in Beijing!",
      "",
      "Amy: Thank you, Ben!"
    ]
  }
